,"started_at":"2026-11-08T18:30:38.892472+00:00","state":"failed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1794159009,"sha":"23217c1d78cafa2fe3a78ce5199653306169cca2","subject":"feat(capture): alias x and s to close outcomes while typing"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"728216870612c7bb7c688632b898aaa276655e32bf2ccfe0795f2196ec316a9c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-is.1/chat.md","size_bytes":6333},"commits":{"digest":"dcf943a693fd80be3794db37f909fa537a4d65fa0c046f816dbb390c40511186","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-is.1/commits.json","size_bytes":237},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-is.1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"a61bf475c7f71b18af885d14eb54b59a93e60fe3818ae39682fa0486cd842c1f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-is.1/meta.json","size_bytes":4421},"prompt":{"digest":"61d3dc7aa939e288da2cfe3c8faec58664562e23e73217453deacd20fec52581","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-is.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":184},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"7c3260cc149f871a7211f1734fabd4d5ae7700e9bcacb7a382de296cd325db52","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-is.1/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":8970},"state":{"digest":"d416488144f5c0384b6a673490d913dea9d8b0dca9b81661cd034aabfa30e6e6","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-is.1/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-08T17:30:46.578361+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-is.1","local_name":"bob-cli-is.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-is","agent_clan_generation":"20261108114340","bead_id":"bob-cli-is.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-is[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Close-outcome letter aliases (x → !, s → *) in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]In the Bob Mac Capture editor, a plain lowercase `x` typed where a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]close selection accepts an outcome marker becomes `!`, and a plain [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]lowercase `s` becomes `*`. Examples: `xx` → `x!`, `xs` → `x*`, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`x1s` → `x1*`, `x=1=s` → `x=1=*`, and `@r:id=xx` → `@r:id=x!`. [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Bob's `capture-rewrite` alone decides where the alias fires. `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]capture`, `capture-parse`, paste, and CLI text keep the letters. [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Typing speed never changes the outcome: keys typed before Bob [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]answers are held and replayed, and a fast Return never files the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]literal draft.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]close_outcome_x_s_typing_aliases.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/close_outcome_x_s_typing_aliases.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-is[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-is/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob capture-rewrite close-outcome alias[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-close-alias[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-close-alias: add an x/s branch to the expand_sigil_alias rule in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli capture-rewrite. It locates a close slot on the draft before the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]key, then checks the swapped selection with the close lexer. Ships with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unit and CLI tests, capture-rewrite help, and capture docs as a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]non-breaking feat(capture).[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac type-ahead hold for meaning-changing rewrite aliases[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-type-ahead-hold[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-type-ahead-hold: generalize the past-segment dash Return deferral [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into a meaning-changing-alias flag. Add a bounded type-ahead hold that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]buffers key-downs while such a rewrite is in flight and replays them [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]after Bob answers. Its first client is the existing x= dash alias. Mac [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]only.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac forwards x/s to Bob's close-outcome alias[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-close-alias[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-close-alias, mac-type-ahead-hold[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-close-alias: forward lowercase non-repeat x/s keys through a lexical[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]send prefilter into the rewrite lane, mark them meaning-changing so the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hold and Return deferral cover them, and add a one-time old-bob probe. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Adds recorded fixtures, tests, Mac docs, the optional decision record, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and an end-to-end check.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-is","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-is.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-205995d5772c6e8b69d714aa1e22dae6","started_at":"2026-11-08T16:44:13.999785+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirem